- **Blockers Available:**\n\
  - **Soulcage Fiend (3/2)** is my only creature in play.\n\
\n\
### **Evaluation**\n\
1. **Hellkite Punisher (7/6 Flying):**\n\
   - If I don’t block, it will deal **7 damage** to me, reducing me to **3 life**.\n\
   - If I block with **Soulcage Fiend (3/2)**, it will trade with the Punisher, but I will take **4 damage** from the Punisher’s remaining power (7 - 2 = 5, but since it’s flying, I can only block with Soulcage Fiend if it had reach, which it doesn’t). **Soulcage Fiend cannot block Hellkite Punisher because it doesn’t have flying or reach.**\n\
\n\
2. **Lightning Shrieker (5/5 Flying, Trample, Haste):**\n\
