- If I block **Lightning Shrieker** with **Soulcage Fiend**, I take **2 trample damage** and **7 damage** from Hellkite Punisher, reducing me to **1 life** (10 - 2 - 7 = 1).\n\
\n\
### **Decision**\n\
- **Block Lightning Shrieker with Soulcage Fiend** to minimize damage and stay alive at **1 life**.\n\
\n\
